  // 12. Generate Standalone README.md
  const readmeMd = `# ${brandName}

> ${headline}

**Archetype:** \`${archetype}\` | **Category:** \`${category}\` | **Generated with:** VibeForge 2.0 Full-Stack Engine

---

## 🚀 Quick Start (Local Run)

